Package: psilocybinresearch
Type: Package
Title: Access Versioned Public Psilocybin Research Metadata
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Christopher B.", "Germann", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "christopher.germann@uni-wh.de", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1573-4651"))
Description: Downloads and verifies versioned public bibliographic metadata from
    Psilocybin-Research.com. Preserves snapshot provenance and SHA-256 checksums,
    reads verified R data files, and summarises annual record counts. The catalogue
    contains bibliographic records, not participant data or a curated collection
    of independent effect sizes for meta-analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, digest
URL: https://psilocybin-research.com/, https://psilocybin-research.com/r-analysis/, https://github.com/psilocybin-research/psilocybinresearch
BugReports: https://github.com/psilocybin-research/psilocybinresearch/issues
Contact: Christopher B. Germann <info@psilocybin-research.com>
